    "questions": [
      {
        "id": 17816,
        "quiz_id": 4819,
        "type": "writing",
        "title": "Many museums charge for admission while others are free. Do you think the advantages of charging people for admission to museums outweigh the disadvantages?",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WLd4dRWE9oi04lx3b3PlryQqgWb\"><em><strong>Many museums charge</strong></em><em><strong> for</strong></em><em><strong> admission while others are free. Do you think the advantages of charging people for admission to museums outweigh the disadvantages?</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 2 - Museum Admission Fees Debate&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/essay-structure-logical-framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theo Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></a></strong></span></em></p>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XPUmdk3CDolUlRxSHyQlOnLogec\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1. Hiểu đề &amp; viết Introduction:</strong></span></h3>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GfxGdT2PjowXfrxZDSLl7Cnogjb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Đề Museum Admission Fees Debate&nbsp;cho 1 xu hướng:</strong> Nhiều bảo t&agrave;ng thu ph&iacute; v&agrave;o cửa trong khi một số kh&aacute;c th&igrave; miễn ph&iacute;.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GbcJdVlXVorPlAxxeVklJZSZglg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Dạng c&acirc;u hỏi:</strong> Lợi &iacute;ch c&oacute; lớn hơn bất lợi kh&ocirc;ng?</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GVEpdUxy1o6uxCxwnAblctgKg7d\">Dựa v&agrave;o đề b&agrave;i Museum Admission Fees Debate&nbsp;v&agrave; c&acirc;u hỏi, ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể viết được phần Introduction. Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, phần Introduction lu&ocirc;n c&oacute; 2 c&acirc;u:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RhbvdfCFMoFQxKxCnahl2NBgg39\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1: </strong>Paraphrase đề b&agrave;i</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IPf6djCIKoqV84xBx3ClYEEZghe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2: </strong>Thesis statement - Trả lời c&acirc;u hỏi</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VflldOFJ7oS9oixRaB3lNPTmgLf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TcQgdqr3coiv24xmBAplfbRngRh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>charging admission fees <em>(thu ph&iacute; v&agrave;o cửa)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XvWYdAwpEoX3PExxCiclEBEugRb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>create certain barriers <em>(tạo ra những r&agrave;o cản nhất định)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n BODY:</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EB3zdgSE8oDcK3x9P4DlIpWAgZe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HzOidr8ZxoTPSFxUkoXlvE4NgYe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X5bHdyGhgoMPdixKUZYlMlHwgRh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AQZSdgBLBobdFaxUWOollK9xgGg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JMmWdMBB0oUZQDxTKk8lgFkQgxd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YH0xdyR6foorHExywJ5lwZXygEg\">Bạn n&ecirc;n thảo luận mỗi quan điểm v&agrave; đưa ra &yacute; kiến c&aacute; nh&acirc;n của m&igrave;nh về việc ủng hộ quan điểm n&agrave;o. Ở đ&acirc;y, theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>&nbsp;với <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận 40/60</strong>, YouPass tin rằng <strong>việc thu ph&iacute; v&agrave;o bảo t&agrave;ng sẽ mang lại lợi &iacute;ch nhiều hơn bất lợi.</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GTbIdmv7homKYXxe8d0llXq6gZd\">&rarr; Với c&aacute;ch lập luận n&agrave;y th&igrave; ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ sắp xếp &yacute; tưởng v&agrave;o 2 BODY như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WawhdMfIRo5zwtxXwhHlj5GEg2d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 1:</strong> M&igrave;nh sẽ đ&oacute;ng vai ng&ocirc;i thứ 3 (concession): thừa nhận một v&agrave;i bất lợi của việc thu ph&iacute; v&agrave;o cửa bảo t&agrave;ng.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VyRsdQ3Dyocqfpx7aH6lwfitgYe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 2:</strong> Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y quan điểm c&aacute; nh&acirc;n rằng thu ph&iacute; v&agrave;o bảo t&agrave;ng mang lại những lợi &iacute;ch đ&aacute;ng kể.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZeqHdZJfvoR6ikxE9sClk29bgvc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LEQ0dwS7nowPZExW2i9l8z0vgEf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><em>(*) Nếu bạn chưa nắm vững về cấu tr&uacute;c đoạn văn v&agrave; logic ph&aacute;t triển &yacute; theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>th&igrave; bạn h&atilde;y xem c&aacute;c b&agrave;i học sau trước khi viết b&agrave;i theo gợi &yacute; ở bước 3 nh&eacute;:</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OLymdBW54ogutCx2USClYflAgPf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ErfadJPNhoGippx8HFylh5IGgxe\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://youpass.vn/course-detail/185/writing-advanced-task-2?collection=lesson&amp;item=161\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Logic sắp xếp th&ocirc;ng tin trong paragraph</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AFbjddKqRoA9AbxpHWPlVjUXgbe\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://youpass.vn/course-detail/185/writing-advanced-task-2?collection=lesson&amp;item=162\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Reason v&agrave; Impact</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PCV9deP2nouqvrxg8eUlsNuegXd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://youpass.vn/course-detail/185/writing-advanced-task-2?collection=lesson&amp;item=645\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Example</a></strong></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J20Yds7vLoEOrrxK31XleiYqgtg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 1: </strong>B&agrave;n về một số bất lợi của việc thu ph&iacute; v&agrave;o bảo t&agrave;ng.</span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TvJGd3R4zoECjjxyRoOl2efgguc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VkpUdS4fwovSvPx9UywlQao3gLb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UlihdFPJuoTdewxs8hOlbfNFgPL\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XAtJdZPu5okOZUxf8TslkFSsgZ7\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D9gxdCk7hobFMFx7lMrlQ1MNgac\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LmbgdliUgouegtx4tDsl7jcFglb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence:</strong> </span>Phải thừa nhận rằng, ph&iacute; v&agrave;o cửa bảo t&agrave;ng c&oacute; thể <em>g&acirc;y ra một số th&aacute;ch thức (pose some challenges)</em> cho c&aacute;c nh&oacute;m người cụ thể.</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AhoGdOvl2oM0AtxXlc4lQc5FgKd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Y3dQkk5oQiJfxm0O4luKJcgDe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1:</strong> Một mối lo ngại lớn l&agrave; việc giảm <em>khả năng tiếp cận gi&aacute;o dục (educational access)</em> đối với học sinh, những người thường c&oacute; ng&acirc;n s&aacute;ch hạn hẹp.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FuYQdFhUOon8GpxaVzOlf1CMgke\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Reason + Impact:</strong> Nhiều học sinh kh&ocirc;ng đủ khả năng chi trả cho c&aacute;c chuyến thăm bảo t&agrave;ng, khiến họ <em>bỏ lỡ (miss out on) -&gt;</em> l&agrave;m tăng <em>sự bất b&igrave;nh đẳng trong gi&aacute;o dục (educational inequality)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LWerdCI8no8XlxxInv5luHOcg8b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FuHAd0KjdoMSQ6xm7S7lVZbggRh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2:</strong> Th&ecirc;m v&agrave;o đ&oacute;, ph&iacute; v&agrave;o cửa cao c&oacute; thể g&acirc;y ra <em>t&aacute;c động ti&ecirc;u cực đến du lịch (negative tourism impact)</em> ở một số khu vực nhất định.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O4gndXddpomR6ux6U4UlpazggSd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Reason + Impact:</strong> Khi ph&iacute; v&agrave;o cửa <em>l&agrave;m nản l&ograve;ng kh&aacute;ch du lịch (deter tourists)</em>, &iacute;t kh&aacute;ch hơn đến th&agrave;nh phố hoặc khu vực, dẫn đến c&aacute;c doanh nghiệp địa phương mất doanh thu v&agrave; tạo ra <em>t&aacute;c động kinh tế ti&ecirc;u cực (negative economic impact)</em> cho cộng đồng địa phương.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ogajd9kkooYFT7xqNLelwX9Agah\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-PTcddY6Kqo7nHcxFb3UlpLsggud\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4. Viết BODY 2: </strong>Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y quan điểm c&aacute; nh&acirc;n rằng thu ph&iacute; v&agrave;o bảo t&agrave;ng mang lại những lợi &iacute;ch đ&aacute;ng kể.</span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Tz5cdshVeoUlfIxSjcZl6FyEgib\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NcXEdRhnVoQ3oyx0pqcl1k7GgMb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I7wVdxu0voPLSOxyXztlxBwcgdb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FBZgdUejJoyWuhxQvKelKRTsgMg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wt6JdJ91hoCdP3xVc7llfIzigec\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DGondG58Ro4e0jxVj2ZlgJlYgRb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence:</strong> </span>Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, t&ocirc;i tin rằng những bất lợi n&agrave;y được b&ugrave; đắp bởi những lợi &iacute;ch đ&aacute;ng kể của việc thu ph&iacute; v&agrave;o cửa.</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UmhddN01poGA6MxsenxlUSVggCg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WYcJdJuuaozPr9xg5WvlMqpdg7d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1:</strong> Ph&iacute; v&agrave;o cửa cung cấp <em>nguồn doanh thu ổn định (steady revenue)</em> để bảo t&agrave;ng c&oacute; thể chi trả cho việc <em>bảo tr&igrave; c&aacute;c hiện vật (proper maintenance of artifacts)</em> v&agrave; <em>bảo tồn di sản văn h&oacute;a (preserve cultural heritage)</em> cho c&aacute;c thế hệ tương lai.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LJ3qddwFmo6YQuxTsMDlbbpqgkb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact:</strong> Đảm bảo rằng c&aacute;c vật trưng b&agrave;y <em>vẫn ở trong t&igrave;nh trạng tốt (remain in good condition)</em> v&agrave; kh&aacute;ch tham quan c&oacute; thể thưởng thức trong nhiều năm tới.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SLNBdy0sbobnDZxHFWhlxzShgrN\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Quc5dSuQpoqMkZxuPgOlkiIQgac\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2:</strong> <em>Doanh thu th&ecirc;m (the extra revenue)</em> từ v&eacute; cho ph&eacute;p c&aacute;c bảo t&agrave;ng <em>đầu tư v&agrave;o c&aacute;c chương tr&igrave;nh gi&aacute;o dục (invest in educational programs)</em> v&agrave; c&aacute;c dự &aacute;n nghi&ecirc;n cứu.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T2yudoq98oDlRexq6xRlIoGZgfe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Reason + Impact:</strong> Thu&ecirc; c&aacute;c nh&agrave; gi&aacute;o dục v&agrave; nh&agrave; nghi&ecirc;n cứu c&oacute; tr&igrave;nh độ -&gt; mang lại trải nghiệm học tập tốt hơn (providing better learning experiences) cho kh&aacute;ch tham quan v&agrave; <em>g&oacute;p phần v&agrave;o sự tiến bộ của tri thức (contributing to knowledge advancement)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Gi1jdfH3YoORBvxfgNplATH6gxe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-BHVjdZmI0oMKnrxn4CtlTdn5gUb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5. Viết Conclusion:</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zu8ndrXoDo0OKIxJZtgljemhguh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EMN7dAA9ronLeRxOw4XlmhQIgmd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xoitd0UzQoDp1xxHOunlKjhIgrf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KhHndXqLgoCSjQxkGzAljeoLgyc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CK7udGSuHodiSmxP39qla1ZAgtc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bạn h&atilde;y viết Conclusion bằng c&aacute;ch <strong>t&oacute;m tắt c&aacute;c luận điểm ch&iacute;nh v&agrave; khẳng định lại quan điểm</strong> của m&igrave;nh nh&eacute;!</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TnhHdnRBJo7op0xzLIslEtncg4e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BlkwdkZL8ohI4nxR7LfllSXIgZd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>heritage preservation <em>(bảo tồn di sản)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ELlsdhBa2oZ9fUxGwN9lcUpJg3d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">educational investment <em>(đầu tư gi&aacute;o dục)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
